&nbsp;Reservation Only.&nbsp;Diabase is located off of Natrona County Road 409 to the west of Pathfinder Dam. Newly improved in 2023 Diabase Campground features 40' long concrete pads, 12' shelters, fire rings and picnic tables at each out of 11 sites. Restroom facilities are available.&nbsp;
There are 2 ADA accessible campsites with beautiful views. Diabase campground is located closest to the boat ramp, dock, and the Pathfinder Marina.&nbsp;Water levels vary greatly at Pathfinder Reservoir. Campsites may be at the waters' edge one year and 1,500 feet away from the water another year.&nbsp;
$13.39 a day&nbsp;plus taxes and fees.&nbsp;
Directions To Diabase Campground
