First Come, First Served.

$15.00 a night.&nbsp;
Sage Campground is located off of Natrona County Road 409 Pathfinder Road to the west of Pathfinder Dam. Campground information and&nbsp;pay boxes are located at multiple kiosks along the roadside of each Natrona County Park.
Sage has sheltered and non-sheltered campsites. ADA accessible campsites are also available with beautiful views and easy access and restroom facilities are available.&nbsp;
 Sage Campground is the middle of three campgrounds located on the marina side of the reservoir.&nbsp;
Please note that water levels vary greatly at Pathfinder Reservoir. Campsites may be at the waters' edge one year and 1,500 feet away from the water another year.
Directions to Sage Campground
