First Come, First Served.&nbsp;
$15.00 a night.&nbsp;
Wolf Point Primitive Camping area is located across the bay from the marina and campgrounds to the southwest of the Pathfinder dam area off of Cardwell Road. Campground information and&nbsp;pay boxes are located at multiple kiosks along the roadside of each Natrona County Park.
Wolf Point has open dry camping with no designated developed camp sites but restroom facilities are available.&nbsp;
The road to Wolf Point is steep and can be rough traveling at times. This location is not recommended for those who like to have people or services near by. Four wheel drive vehicles are also recommended for this area. There are no boat ramps or docks in this area.
Please note that water levels vary greatly at Pathfinder Reservoir. Campsites may be at the waters' edge one year and 1,500 feet away from the water another year.
